Body:
Adding a quick usage note for reviewers:

Enable hashline mode in `opencode.jsonc`:

```jsonc
{
  "experimental": {
    "hashline_edit": true,
    "hashline_autocorrect": true
  }
}
```

- `hashline_edit`: enables `LINE#ID` read output and hashline `edit` payloads
- `hashline_autocorrect`: optional cleanup for copied prefixes/formatting artifacts
